  "title": "EVAL-SCS006V1 No Load power consumption",
  "content": "<p>EVAL-SCS006V1 (TSUSB4532) is plugged into a 65W power supply with an in-line USB-C meter. </p><p>With no load attached, the meter reads 20.06V, 0.016A, and 0.321W. What on the board that consumes this much power?</p><p>In contrast, an EVAL-SCS006V1 (STUSB4500) is plugged into the same configuration, the meeter reads 20.07V, 0.000A, 0.000W.</p><p>Please help me figure this out!</p><p> </p>",
